          "code": "VALIDATIONFAILED",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774954742505",
          "id": "1774795127214",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774795127258_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "##Objective\nYou are responsible for displaying validation errors in the Modify Subscription flow.\nUse the validation output from:\n$context.$nodes.VALIDATEASSETMODIFICATIONINPUTFIELDS.$output.result\n\n##Input\nInputs (do not change)\nisValid: {{$context.$nodes.VALIDATEASSETMODIFICATIONINPUTFIELDS.$output.result.isValid}}\neffectiveDateWithinRange: {{$context.$nodes.VALIDATEASSETMODIFICATIONINPUTFIELDS.$output.result.effectiveDateWithinRange}}\nquantityValid: {{$context.$nodes.VALIDATEASSETMODIFICATIONINPUTFIELDS.$output.result.quantityValid}}\nchangeReasonValid: {{$context.$nodes.VALIDATEASSETMODIFICATIONINPUTFIELDS.$output.result.changeReasonValid}}\n\n##Validation Definition\nMeaning of validation flags\neffectiveDateWithinRange === false means the effective date provided for the modification is not valid.\nquantityValid === false means the quantity provided is invalid (for example, negative or otherwise not acceptable).\nchangeReasonValid === false means the change reason provided is invalid. Change reason is the reason to perform modification on the subscription.\nDecision logic\nIf isValid === true: do not show any error.\nIf isValid === false: show an error message determined by the flags below:\nIf any of effectiveDateWithinRange, quantityValid, or changeReasonValid is false, display one combined error message that lists all failing validations\nIf only effectiveDateWithinRange === false: show only the effective date error.\nIf only quantityValid === false: show only the quantity error.\nIf only changeReasonValid === false: show only the change reason error.\n\n##Ouput Requirements\nOnly display the error message in the output , do not output any decision logic.\nDisplay the error message in a user friendly manner.\nAlways ask to correct the errors and resubmit."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1774750918705",
            "name": "MODIFYASSETVALIDATIONFAILEDPROMPTEXTRACTOR",
